"description":"Welcome to Drive Ahead!, you win by hitting your friends on the head with cars! Drive Ahead! is the ultimate multiplayer battling retro game with cars, unpredictable chaos and driving. Battle with fun cars, like a monster truck, a tank or a 4x4 off-roader. There's tons of content to unlock and game modes to master.\n\nFUN, FAST, ACTION PACKED BATTLES WITH CARS\nGrab the wheel while driving into lightning fast party games! In Drive Ahead!, you'll reign supreme by winning matches in easy to start yet hard to master multiplayer fights. Drive ahead into crazy 2 player games, have fun driving alone or with friends!\n\nMASTER ALL 250+ CARS\nTo improve driving these over the top cars, be it a monster truck or even motorbikes, you need practice, and a garage full of options. Perhaps driving tanks, a battle ship on wheels or a racing bike is more your thing, collect all the cars to impress your friends or rivals in multiplayer!\n\nKING OF THE HILL & MISSION STADIUMS\nHow long can you reign in King of the Hill against an endless flow of opponents before you go kaboom? Explore exotic stylized Mission Stadiums for amazing rewards, while avoiding hazards like robots, aliens and penguins. Seriously, the penguins are the most dangerous.\n\nPLAY IN 2 PLAYER OFFLINE PARTY GAMES\nA fighter must train at all times, we support offline 2 player games to party with your friends in Drive Ahead! to help you ascend as a master of your favorite cars and retro big rigs!\n\nHundreds of pixel cars, helmets, levels, missions, and game modes bring endless hours of helmet-crashing two-player racing action with freak accidents! Just be careful not to wreck yourself!\n\nPrivacy policy: https://www.dodreams.com/termsofserviceprivacypolicy \nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "averageUserRating":4.622189999999999798774297232739627361297607421875, "trackCensoredName":"Drive Ahead! Fun Car Battles", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/a